{"cited_chunk_ids_snapshot":["goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus:p3737:3736","goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus:p4108:4107","goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus:p655:0654"],"cited_chunk_set_delta":{"added":["goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus:p3737:3736","goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus:p4108:4107","goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus:p655:0654"],"removed":[]},"event_checksum":"7fc6efd2e35b3d2e3a9aea901e5c1541023cbfae8ee423c74af50ce716bb4904","frontmatter_field_changes":["citations","id","reading_id","schema_version","summary","tags","title"],"frontmatter_snapshot":{"card_edges":[],"citations":[{"chunk_hash":"1ae954a0d9ea539c68aac07b7c8103aa2bb67f669d468f286e6be0f35f4b9e62","chunk_id":"goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus:p4108:4107","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[4108,4108],"quote":"阿里騰訊中海油還可以，其他的真的不怎麼樣","source_id":"goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus"},{"chunk_hash":"0deefab405b8908be2383330b0a1b62cf175be43c78f2f8afaa49e9b234bc3a4","chunk_id":"goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus:p655:0654","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[655,655],"quote":"港股期權我基本上掛中間價一定會成交，美股期權卻經常出現掛中間價沒有成交的情況。我估計是因為行使價太多以及到期日太多的原故，價差的損失也是我的一個考慮","source_id":"goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus"},{"chunk_hash":"8dfb4f090b7859416c7ea9e762c56b39db384fb91929dafc9498e0922a2deed7","chunk_id":"goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus:p3737:3736","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[3737,3737],"quote":"多久一次並不是問題，問題在於流動性。","source_id":"goubujiao_xueqiu_corpus"}],"id":"gbj-hk-option-liquidity-megacaps","reading_id":"14_microstructure_and_trading","schema_version":"cacg.v0","summary":"HK stock options had usable liquidity only in a few mega-caps (Alibaba, Tencent, CNOOC) in the author's 2022-H1 practice. A mid-price quote in HK almost always fills; in US options mids often miss — his own guess blames the far larger strike/expiry count — so spread loss is an explicit trade-selection cost. He picks markets and expiries by liquidity, not expiry frequency.","tags":["xueqiu-2022h1","hk-options","liquidity","bid-ask-spread","market-microstructure","option-selling"],"title":"HK option liquidity is concentrated in a few mega-caps; pick market by liquidity not frequency"},"is_retracted":false,"new_card_hash":"06c45afff4c518aa783a343d085fe5004f38aac6de81a45e5879a08ee255cf53","prev_card_hash":null,"prev_checksum":null,"schema_version":"cacg.v0","seq":0,"timestamp":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z"}
